meta {
  name: Lectures
  seq: 14
}

docs {
  Each teacher has a library of PDFs and shares them with any students they
  choose; access stays until the teacher removes it, and every change is kept
  in the lecture's access history. Uses `teacherToken`
  (Auth > Login as teacher) and `studentToken` (Grades > Login as student),
  so run those first. The files are private: readers get links that work for
  a few minutes. The last request deletes the demo lecture again.
}
